m&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8WBFp5UstsBN6KFD6Fw7vrl80vZziGoONvY0Sv-p7pBQ&oe=6A26E8C7"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot3AttackMeta.png", "id": "802853259406872", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818890_802853262740205_8927864492186091726_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iN9NzP9bFggQ7kNvwGwwgus&_nc_oc=AdpFvLnO8CsL-djbHXEHvhV__SZyKfhPU4K6aEt9MM6aJIekSXZKwJ2eYRQxsPCEzpU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-bRYxSS0N7ERP4ffq7-O2CskqVF9AKGg23X6EpnphXHw&oe=6A26C605"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot5AttackMeta.png", "id": "2423145574750027", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825563_2423145578083360_1084822089398020649_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HlMv6Ox0NLcQ7kNvwEStWDp&_nc_oc=Ado3kAFvGM5be1GX_M17L3k65me1WULIpotbwInY9wQLMdtdt8P6Ah7cPhi3Z6_m2l8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9zTJKM8mt3_5v9VMEtIEf9KaHikJZvfP9g6Ap3FHHNww&oe=6A26C809"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560attackof.png", "id": "3270720336410758", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821702_3270720339744091_1875579091859709523_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xUuqGYDDll0Q7kNvwEB8W2T&_nc_oc=AdrVOXNk_-inM5u_sVUcM91jbRS31R08ZH-qzqa3Sc40MqxwKZHtaf9DzkKmd_XgOr8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_A_ZFYnP_LWhg10UkSCR4-CQzOWUBeYdS8-KkUrXYV9A&oe=6A26BB9D"}, "display_name": "Attack of the Zombie Elves", "keywords": ["MixedReality", "Sport", "Soccer", "Football"], "long_description": "Attack of the Zombie Elves transforms your room into a chaotic holiday showdown. Mischievous zombie elves appear directly in your space and try to steal the packages placed around your Christmas tree. Your task is simple and hectic: stop them before they escape or chase them down to recover the stolen gifts. Meanwhile, coins pop up around you and boost your score, creating a fun and constant decision between defending your presents and going for high points.\n\nYou interact using a real physical ball, turning your movement into playful mixed reality action. When you move, swing, or push your ball, the elves react with humorous, exaggerated animations that bring the scene to life. Your physical space becomes part of the gameplay, making every round dynamic and energetic.\n\nBefore the action starts, you set everything up using only hand tracking. Place your tree, position your starter package, adjust the ball size, and define your play area with simple gestures. Once the game begins, virtual elements blend naturally with your room using passthrough, adaptive brightness, and depth features that make the elves feel grounded in your real environment.\n\nAs the game progresses, the pressure increases. More elves enter your space, packages disappear, coins tempt you, and the chaos builds. Every decision becomes faster, funnier, and more physical as you move through your room trying to keep everything under control.\n", "short_description": "Attack of the Zombie Elves is a fast and playful mixed reality game where zombie elves sneak into your room, steal your packages, and you use a real ball to stop them or get your gifts back. Collect coins, protect your tree, and survive the holiday chaos \u2014 all playable with hand tracking and a real physical ball."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://xrchris.com/data-privacyprivacy-policy-attack-of-the-zombie-elves-meta-quest-app/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Christoph Spinger", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://xrchris.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": 